From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] shell: focus the GTK4 overlay after controller setup

The top-level key controller only receives events when the fullscreen shell
owns keyboard focus. Explicitly focus the shell overlay after attaching the
controller so startup and Activity return both have a deterministic focus
target.

---
 src/jarabe/main.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/jarabe/main.py b/src/jarabe/main.py
--- a/src/jarabe/main.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/main.py
@@ -300,3 +300,4 @@ def _setup_main_window(shell_instance):
         zoom_controller.connect("key-pressed", _capture_zoom_key)
         shell_instance._main_window.add_controller(zoom_controller)
         shell_instance._sugar_zoom_controller = zoom_controller
+        shell_instance._main_window.set_focus(shell_instance._overlay)
